{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magecraft: Spellbuilding</strong> is a deckbuilder with a focus on crafting your own spell cards and creating unique decks to take with you into the turn-based combat of the Dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While you have control over the cards you start with, the randomized Dungeon layouts, enemy encounters, passive powers, and scrolls ensure that no two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_features.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Counter.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Card_Clash.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on enemy attacks, destroying them to keep yourself safe from harm - or take the hit and attack enemies directly to do as much damage as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Dungeon.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Dungeon.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through three distinct, themed dungeons, each with its own sets of enemies to defeat, powers and scrolls to collect, and events with with different choices to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Sigils.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Sigils.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine <strong>over 50</strong> Sigils - with effects that deal damage, inflict debuffs, grant buffs, summon allies, and more - to craft custom spell cards for your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Customize.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Characters.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between a variety of appearances, color palettes, and unique Background powers when creating a character - and unlock new character colors to change into, as well as new characters with powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Abyss.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Abyss.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Abyss is a separate  mode with randomized characters and starting decks, where unlike the main game, dying means starting a new run from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641420?t=1744654940","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/5a51823d3ca80e304eab703040f99608717c2d2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744654940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/4eef94ae0f3315d7b0c718ac4aac35be42be632b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744654940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/4eef94ae0f3315d7b0c718ac4aac35be42be632b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744654940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magecraft: Spellbuilding</strong> is a deckbuilder with a focus on crafting your own spell cards and creating unique decks to take with you into the turn-based combat of the Dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While you have control over the cards you start with, the randomized Dungeon layouts, enemy encounters, passive powers, and scrolls ensure that no two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_features.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Counter.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Card_Clash.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on enemy attacks, destroying them to keep yourself safe from harm - or take the hit and attack enemies directly to do as much damage as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Dungeon.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Dungeon.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through three distinct, themed dungeons, each with its own sets of enemies to defeat, powers and scrolls to collect, and events with with different choices to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Sigils.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Sigils.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine <strong>over 50</strong> Sigils - with effects that deal damage, inflict debuffs, grant buffs, summon allies, and more - to craft custom spell cards for your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Customize.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Characters.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between a variety of appearances, color palettes, and unique Background powers when creating a character - and unlock new character colors to change into, as well as new characters with powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/banner_-_Abyss.png?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/gif_-_Abyss.gif?t=1744654940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Abyss is a separate  mode with randomized characters and starting decks, where unlike the main game, dying means starting a new run from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Violet Grimoire"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/0b88b9e59d989dd81a99b6f06e9937716424f31c/header.jpg?t=1744654940","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Magecraft: Spellbuilding","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Violet Grimoire"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/199f0a1aaaa434293c99a823113a255bbd337ffb/ss_199f0a1aaaa434293c99a823113a255bbd337ffb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744654940","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/199f0a1aaaa434293c99a823113a255bbd337ffb/ss_199f0a1aaaa434293c99a823113a255bbd337ffb.600x338.jpg?t=1744654940"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/c28464ca3f3371f8330439d42cf337ce72fb8ed4/ss_c28464ca3f3371f8330439d42cf337ce72fb8ed4.1920x1080.jpg?t=17